/*
  InfrastructureSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0006 · InfrastructureSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  InfrastructureSection resolves (table "InfrastructureSection") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/devtools/InfrastructureSection.tsx — and its ToolCard /
  ResultPanel / BackendTool helpers). The web has no i18n entries for these keys, so
  react-i18next renders the key string itself; the values below reproduce that
  verbatim so the native copy matches the web exactly. The remaining keys back the
  native-only chrome (freshness/offline/idle/error copy + accessibility).
*/

